    "description_uz": "48 kungacha bo'lgan batareya ishlash muddatini ta'minlovchi Power Sapphire quyosh energiyasidan quvvat oluvchi linza ovozli xabarlar va boshqaruv uchun dinamik va mikrofon yorqin o'rnatilgan LED chiroq muayyan sport turlari uchun kuch-quvvat mashg'ulotlari\nMustahkam dizayn\nUzoq xizmat qilish uchun mo'ljallangan ushbu premium dizayn sho'ng'in uchun mos keladi hamda sizib chiqishdan himoyalangan tugmalar, datchikning metall himoyasi va tirnalishga chidamli sapfir shisha va titan bezelga ega har doim yoqilgan 1,3 dyuymli quyoshdan quvvat oluvchi displey bilan jihozlangan. U issiqlikka, zarbaga va suvga chidamlilik bo'yicha AQSh harbiy standartlariga muvofiq sinovdan o'tkazilgan.\nO'rnatilgan dinamik va mikrofon\nSmarfonga ulanganda sport soatingiz orqali qo'ng'iroqlarni amalga oshiring va qabul qiling. Bunga qo'shimcha ravishda, tarmoqqa ulanmasdan ovozli buyruqlar yordamida soat funksiyalarini boshqaring — yoki matnli xabarlarga javob berish va boshqalar uchun smartfoningizning ovozli yordamchisidan foydalaning.\nO'rnatilgan LED chiroq\nO'zgaruvchan yorug'lik intensivligi va qizil xavfsizlik signaliga ega haqiqiy integratsiyalashgan chiroq qorong'ida yaxshiroq mo'ljal olishni ta'minlaydi va kerak bo'lganda qulay yoritishni taqdim etadi. Stroboskop rejimi hatto yugurish ritmingizga moslashishi mumkin.\nErtalabki hisobot\nUyg'onishingiz bilan uyqungiz, mashg me'yori, YUQO (HRV) holati, ob-havo va boshqalar haqida sozlanishi mumkin bo'lgan sharhni oling.\nYUQO holati\nUyqu paytida umumiy salomatligingiz, tiklanishingiz va mashg'ulotlar samaradorligini yanada yaxshiroq tushunib bering.\nBilakdagi pulsomer\nUshbu sport soati mashg'ulotlar paytida qanchalik astoydil harakat qilayotganingizni baholashga yordam berish uchun yurak urish tezligini doimiy ravishda o'lchab boradi.\nPulsoksometr datchigi\nUyg'oqlik va uyqu paytida qondagi kislorod to'yinishi darajasini kuzatib boring va balandlikka qanday moslashayotganingiz haqida ma'lumotga ega bo'ling.\nGarmin Connect ilovasi\nSalomatligingiz va jismoniy holatingiz haqidagi ma'lumotlarni ko'ring, do'stlaringiz bilan muloqot qiling va boshqalar.\nGarmin Messenger™ ilovasi\nTo'g'ridan-to'g'ri bilagingizda ikki tomonlama matnli xabarlar orqali muloqot qiling.\nAqlli bildirishnomalar\niPhone® yoki Android™ smartfoniga ulanganingizda sport smart-soatingizda elektron pochta, matnli xabarlar va ogohlantirishlarni qabul qiling.\nMusiqa\nSpotify, Deezer yoki Amazon Music hisoblaringizdan qo'shiqlar va pleylistlarni yuklab oling (obuna talab qilinishi mumkin). Smartfonsiz tinglash uchun simsiz quloqchinlardan foydalaning.\nGarmin Pay™ kontaktsiz to'lovlari\nHamkor yetkazib beruvchilar ko'magida kassa navbatlaridan yoki tranzit tizimlaridan tezda o'ting.",
    "description_en": "Power Sapphire solar charging lens for extended battery life up to 48 days of battery life in smartwatch mode speaker and microphone for voice messages and control bright built-in LED flashlight sport-specific strength workouts\nDurable design\nBuilt to last, this premium design is dive-rated and features leak-proof buttons, a metal sensor guard cover and an always-on 1.3-inch solar charged display with a scratch-resistant sapphire lens and titanium bezel. It is tested to U.S. military standards for thermal, shock and water resistance.\nBuilt-in speaker and microphone\nMake and take phone calls from your smartwatch when paired with your smartphone. Plus, control watch functions with off-grid voice commands — or use your smartphone's voice assistant to respond to text messages and more.\nBuilt-in LED flashlight\nA true integrated flashlight with variable light intensities and a red safety light gives you greater awareness in the dark, providing convenient illumination when you need it. Strobe mode can even match your running cadence.\nMorning report\nReceive a customizable overview of your sleep, training outlook, HRV status, weather and more as soon as you wake up.\nHRV status\nGain a better understanding of your overall health, recovery and training performance while you sleep.\nWrist-based heart rate\nThis smartwatch constantly samples your heart rate to help you gauge how hard you work during activities.\nPulse Ox sensor\nTrack your blood oxygen saturation while you’re awake or asleep, and gain awareness of how you’re adapting to altitude.\nGarmin Connect app\nSee your health and fitness information, connect with friends and more.\nGarmin Messenger™ app\nCommunicate via two-way text messaging right on your wrist.\nSmart notifications\nReceive emails, texts and alerts on your smartwatch when paired with your iPhone® or Android™ smartphone.\nMusic\nDownload songs and playlists from your Spotify, Deezer or Amazon Music accounts (subscription may be required). Use wireless headphones for phone-free listening.\nGarmin Pay™ contactless payments\nBreeze through checkout lines or transit systems with participating providers."
