    "tagline_en": "Universal",
    "description_uz": "Garmin brendining Venu X1 aqlli soatlari - bu uslub, funksionallik va ishonchlilik uyg'unligidir.\nVenu X1 - bu faollik va salomatlikni kuzatish uchun ko'plab imkoniyatlarni taklif etuvchi aqlli soat. Ular GPS bilan jihozlangan bo'lib, bu sizga yo'nalishlaringiz va bosib o'tilgan masofalarni kuzatish imkonini beradi. Venu X1 aqlli soatlari salomatligingizni monitoring qilish uchun ham ko'plab funksiyalarni taklif etadi. Ular yurak urish tezligini, qondagi kislorod darajasini va hatto uyqu sifatini kuzatishi mumkin. Batareyaning ishlash muddati (aqlli soat rejimi) 8 kungacha.\nVenu X1 ham erkaklar, ham ayollar uchun mos keladigan zamonaviy dizaynga ega. Ular aniq va yorqin tasvirni ta'minlaydigan katta ekran bilan jihozlangan.\nGarmin brendining Venu X1 aqlli soatlari - bu salomatligingiz va faolligingizni kuzatib borishga yordam beradigan ishonchli va funksional aksessuardir.",
    "description_en": "Venu X1 smartwatches from Garmin combine style, functionality, and reliability.\nVenu X1 is a smartwatch that offers a multitude of possibilities for tracking activity and health. It features GPS, allowing you to track your routes and distances covered. Venu X1 smartwatches also offer numerous features for monitoring your health. They can track heart rate, blood oxygen levels, and even sleep quality. Battery life (smartwatch mode) Up to 8 days.\nVenu X1 features a stylish design suitable for both men and women. It is equipped with a large screen that provides a clear and bright image.\nVenu X1 smartwatches from Garmin are a reliable and functional accessory that will help you keep track of your health and activity."
