    "name_uz": "Tactix 8 Standard, AMOLED / Solar 51mm",
    "name_en": "Tactix 8 Standard, AMOLED / Solar 51mm",
    "tagline_uz": "Taktik",
    "tagline_en": "Tactical",
    "description_uz": "Aqlli soat rejimida 29 kungacha batareya quvvati\nYo'naltirish faoliyati va Applied Ballistics® yechimi kabi maxsus taktik funksiyalar, yorqin o'rnatilgan ko'p rangli LED chiroq\n40 metrgacha sho'ng'ish reytingi bilan yangi chuqurliklarga erishing, ovozli xabarlar va boshqaruv uchun karnay va mikrofon\nChidamlilik uchun yaratilgan\nUshbu takomillashtirilgan taktik GPS aqlli soati yorqin 1,4 dyuymli displey va yaxshilangan grafik interfeys bilan jihozlangan. U issiqlikka, zarbaga va suvga chidamlilik bo'yicha AQSh harbiy standartlariga muvofiq sinovdan o'tgan.\nSiz qo'mondonlik qilasiz\nMaxsus taktik funksiyalarga parashütchi funksiyasi, yo'nalish nuqtalarini proyeksiyalash, ikki pozitsiyali GPS formati, yashirin rejim (stealth mode), favqulodda o'chirish (kill switch), tungi ko'rish ko'zoynaklari bilan moslik va harakatlanish funksiyasi kiradi.\nHujumga boshchilik qiling\nSatIQ™ texnologiyasiga ega ko'p diapazonli GPS, shuningdek, 3 o'qli kompas, giroskop va barometrik balandlik o'lchagich uchun o'rnatilgan datchiklar yordamida atrof-muhit bo'ylab tengsiz joylashuv aniqligi bilan harakatlaning.\nAmaliy ballistika\nOldindan yuklangan Applied Ballistics® yechimi dala sharoitida uzoq masofaga otish uchun mo'ljallash yechimlariga kirish imkonini beradi.\nHaskorona dayving\n40 metrli sho'ng'ish reytingi evaziga siz har qachongidan ham chuqurroq sho'ng'ishga tayyorsiz, shuningdek, suv ostida suzish va nafasni ushlab sho'ng'ish bilan shug'ullanishingiz mumkin.\nO'rnatilgan chiroq\nKam yoritilgan sharoitlarda yo'lingizni yoritishga yordam berish uchun o'rnatilgan ko'p rangli LED chiroq yashil yoki oq chiroqning yorqin, barqaror nuriga tezkor kirishni ta'minlaydi. NVG rejimida oq chiroq o'chadi, yashil chiroq esa xiralashtiriladigan bo'ladi.",
    "description_en": "Up to 29 days of battery life in smartwatch mode\nSpecialized tactical features such as direct routing activity and Applied Ballistics® solver, bright built-in multi-color LED flashlight\nReach new depths with a 40-meter dive rating, speaker and microphone for voice messaging and control\nBuilt to endure\nThis advanced tactical GPS smartwatch is equipped with a bright 1.4-inch display, as well as an improved graphical interface. It has been tested to U.S. military standards for thermal, shock and water resistance.\nYou command\nSpecial tactical features include Jumpmaster activity, waypoint projection, dual-position GPS format, stealth mode, kill switch, night vision goggle compatibility and tactical movement feature.\nLead the charge\nNavigate your surroundings with unmatched positioning accuracy thanks to multi-band GPS with SatIQ™ technology, as well as built-in sensors for a 3-axis compass, gyroscope and barometric altimeter.\nApplied Ballistics\nThe preloaded Applied Ballistics® solver gives you access to aiming solutions for long-range shooting in the field.\nRecreational diving\nWith a 40-meter dive rating, you are ready to dive deeper than ever before, plus you can enjoy scuba diving and freediving.\nBuilt-in flashlight\nTo help guide your way in low-light conditions, a built-in multi-color LED flashlight provides quick access to a bright, steady beam of green or white light. In NVG mode, white light is disabled and the green flashlight becomes dimmable."
