    "tagline_uz": "Taktik Solar",
    "tagline_en": "Tactical Solar",
    "description_uz": "Garmin Instinct 3 Solar Tactical Edition\nQora rangdagi mustahkam 45 millimetrli GPS-smart-soat. U quyoshdan quvvat olish funksiyasi, harbiy darajadagi chidamlilik va maxsus taktik vositalar bilan jihozlangan.\nKorpus oʻlchami: 45 mm, metall bilan mustahkamlangan bezelga ega tola bilan mustahkamlangan polimer. Rang: Qora korpus va qora silikon tasmacha. Suvga chidamlilik: 10 atmosfera (100 metrgacha). Quvvatlanish: Quyoshdan quvvat oluvchi linza smart-soat rejimida uzoq muddatli yoki deyarli cheksiz avtonom ish vaqtini ta'minlaydi. Displey: Quyoshda yaxshi koʻrinadigan pikseldagi xotira (MIP) ekrani, oʻrnatilgan svetodiodli chiroq (oq va yashil yorugʻlik) bilan.\n\nTaktik va navigatsiya funksiyalari\nPinhona rejim (Stealth mode) va favqulodda oʻchirish tugmasi (kill switch): simsiz aloqani oʻchiradi va foydalanuvchi xotirasini zumda tozalashi mumkin. Dala sharoitida navigatsiya: SatIQ texnologiyasiga ega koʻp diapazonli GPS, 3 oʻqli kompas va barometrik altimetr. Operativ qoʻllab-quvvatlash: paraşyutchi yoʻriqchisi faoliyati, yoʻl nuqtalarini proyeksiyalash, ikkita pozitsiyalash nuqtasiga ega GPS-ma'lumotlar formati va marsh-brosok profillari. Salomatlikni kuzatish: bilakdagi yurak urish tezligini oʻlchash, pulsoksimetriya va kengaytirilgan uyqu monitoringi.",
    "description_en": "Garmin Instinct 3 Solar Tactical Edition\nRugged 45 mm GPS smartwatch in black. It features solar charging, military-grade durability, and specialized tactical tools.\nCase size: 45 mm, fiber-reinforced polymer with metal bezel reinforcement. Color: Black case with black silicone strap. Water rating: 10 ATM (up to 100 meters). Power: Solar charging lens provides extended or virtually unlimited battery life in smartwatch mode. Display: Sunlight-visible memory-in-pixel screen with built-in LED flashlight (white and green light).\n\nTactical and navigation features\nStealth mode and kill switch: disable wireless communications and can instantly wipe user memory. Field navigation: multi-band GPS with SatIQ technology, 3-axis compass, and barometric altimeter. Operational support: Jumpmaster activity, waypoint projection, dual-position GPS format, and rucking profiles. Health tracking: wrist-based heart rate, Pulse Ox, and advanced sleep monitoring."
