    "description_uz": "Aqlli soat rejimida 16 kungacha batareya quvvatini ta'minlaydigan yorqin, aniq AMOLED-displey\nYo'naltirish faoliyati va Applied Ballistics® yechimi kabi maxsus taktik funksiyalar, yorqin o'rnatilgan ko'p rangli LED chiroq\n40 metrlik sho'ng'ish reytingi bilan yangi chuqurliklarga erishing, ovozli xabarlar va boshqaruv uchun karnay va mikrofon\nChidamli bo'lish uchun yaratilgan\nUshbu takomillashtirilgan taktik GPS aqlli soati yorqin 1.4 dyuymli AMOLED-displey, titan bezeli va sapfir oynasi, shuningdek yaxshilangan grafik interfeys bilan jihozlangan. U issiqlik, zarba va suvga chidamlilik bo'yicha AQSh harbiy standartlariga muvofiq sinovdan o'tkazilgan.\nSiz qo'mondonlik qilasiz\nMaxsus taktik funksiyalarga parashütchi funksiyasi, yo'nalish nuqtalarini proyeksiyalash, ikki pozitsiyali GPS formati, yashirin rejim (stealth mode), favqulodda o'chirish (kill switch), tungi ko'rish ko'zoynaklari bilan moslik va harakatlanish funksiyasi kiradi.\nHujumga boshchilik qiling\nSatIQ™ texnologiyasiga ega ko'p diapazonli GPS, shuningdek 3 o'qli kompas, giroskop va barometrik balandlik o'lchagich uchun o'rnatilgan datchiklar yordamida atrof-muhit bo'ylab mislsiz joylashuv aniqligi bilan harakatlaning.\nApplied Ballistics\nOldindan yuklangan Applied Ballistics® yechimi sizga dala sharoitida uzoq masofaga o'q otish uchun mo'ljalga olish yechimlaridan foydalanish imkonini beradi.\nHaskorona dayving\n40 metr chuqurlikka sho'ng'ish reytingi bilan siz har qachongidan ham chuqurroq sho'ng'ishga, shuningdek suv ostida suzish va nafasni ushlab turib sho'ng'ishga tayyorsiz.\nO'rnatilgan chiroq\nKam yoritilgan sharoitda yo'lingizni topishga yordam berish uchun o'rnatilgan ko'p rangli LED chiroq yashil yoki oq yorug'likning yorqin, barqaror nuriga tezkor kirishni ta'minlaydi. NVG rejimida oq yorug'lik o'chiriladi, yashil chiroq esa xiralashtiriladigan bo'ladi.",
    "description_en": "Bright, clear AMOLED display with up to 16 days of battery life in smartwatch mode\nSpecialized tactical features such as direct routing activity and Applied Ballistics® solver, bright built-in multicolor LED flashlight\nReach new depths with a 40-meter dive rating, speaker and microphone for voice messaging and control\nBuilt to endure\nThis advanced tactical GPS smartwatch features a bright 1.4-inch AMOLED display, a titanium bezel, and sapphire lens, along with an improved graphical interface. It is tested to U.S. military standards for thermal, shock, and water resistance.\nYou are in command\nSpecial tactical features include Jumpmaster activity, waypoint projection, dual-position GPS format, stealth mode, kill switch, night vision goggle compatibility, and stealth movement feature.\nLead the charge\nNavigate your surroundings with superior positioning accuracy thanks to multi-band GPS with SatIQ™ technology, as well as built-in sensors for a 3-axis compass, gyroscope, and barometric altimeter.\nApplied Ballistics\nThe preloaded Applied Ballistics® solver gives you access to aiming solutions for long-range shooting in the field.\nRecreational diving\nWith a 40-meter dive rating, you are ready to dive deeper than ever before, as well as engage in scuba diving and freediving.\nBuilt-in flashlight\nTo help guide your way in low-light conditions, a built-in multicolor LED flashlight provides quick access to a bright, steady beam of green or white light. In NVG mode, white light is disabled and the green flashlight becomes dimmable."
